    ('R05', 'Data Professional / Data Analyst', '2524', 'DATA PROFESSIONALS Data Professionals is the collection of workforces primarily specialising in the data science field, ie that provides meaningful information based on large amounts of complex data or big data. It combines different fields of work in statistics and computation to interpret data for decision-making purposes. Tasks include: a) preparing documentation to outline data sources, models and algorithms used and developed; b) extracting data from data sources; c) proposing new uses for existing data sources and structures; d) integrating multiple data sets to build large and complex data sets; e) building software to scrub, combine and manage data; f) applying data mining techniques to investigate leads, identify patterns and regularities in data; g) implementing automated processes to produce scale models; h) developing complex code, scripts and data pipelines to process structured and unstructured data; i) testing data system configurations to increase efficiency; j) enabling searching, data visualisation, and advanced analytics functionality; k) monitoring data system.', 'medium', 'high', TRUE, ARRAY[-0.01085152,0.01296730,-0.01911095,0.04434834,-0.07354402,-0.13089830,-0.02766507,0.02132087,-0.09133517,0.07676974,-0.06652727,-0.07146848,0.03248983,-0.00564645,-0.04711843,0.05153994,-0.04397371,-0.03818924,-0.04243398,-0.04306534,-0.05625328,-0.01353212,-0.06569368,-0.01711175,0.01075332,0.03360260,0.06321733,-0.05550456,-0.02413244,-0.00158417,-0.05630874,-0.00446912,0.06146222,0.08583507,-0.05621944,0.01099244,0.01958737,0.09916478,0.00920848,0.06319987,-0.09034999,-0.04488674,-0.01999895,-0.01748920,0.01598468,-0.01578584,-0.00010553,-0.05525225,-0.02035428,0.04816461,-0.09520435,-0.04542698,0.00159859,0.01055920,-0.03210549,-0.03638856,0.07187703,-0.03136298,0.01198387,-0.00802074,-0.03058302,-0.03344911,-0.02814841,-0.02001730,0.03449195,0.00591144,-0.07006487,0.04839910,0.04002170,-0.05616139